    "title": "iDaft Jamming-Daft Punk Sounds",
    "description": "iDaft Jamming is a tribute to some of Daft Punk\u2019s most iconic songs:\r\n\u201cHarder Better Faster Stronger\u201d\r\n\"Around The World\"\r\n\"Aerodynamic\"\r\n\"Technologic\"\r\n\"Robot Rock\" \r\n\"One More Time\"\r\n\r\nTHIS IS THE FAMOUS APP WHICH WENT VIRAL ON TIK TOK - NOW FINALLY ALSO AVAILABLE ON ANDROID!\r\nIf you want to see some of the videos there, just search for this app: \r\n31+ million views and counting!\r\n\r\n\r\nHave your own jam sessions with these awesome soundboards!\r\n\r\nChoose whether you want to jam along to the beat or just go plain \"a cappella\".\r\n\r\nDon't forget to share your experiences on your favorite social platform! \r\n\r\nHappy Jamming!\r\n\r\n\r\n(Daft Punk or their record label is not in any way affiliated with this app)\r\n\r\n\r\n...maybe also some hidden bonus material...",
    "descriptionHTML": "iDaft Jamming is a tribute to some of Daft Punk\u2019s most iconic songs:<br>\u201cHarder Better Faster Stronger\u201d<br>&quot;Around The World&quot;<br>&quot;Aerodynamic&quot;<br>&quot;Technologic&quot;<br>&quot;Robot Rock&quot; <br>&quot;One More Time&quot;<br><br>THIS IS THE FAMOUS APP WHICH WENT VIRAL ON TIK TOK - NOW FINALLY ALSO AVAILABLE ON ANDROID!<br>If you want to see some of the videos there, just search for this app: <br>31+ million views and counting!<br><br><br>Have your own jam sessions with these awesome soundboards!<br><br>Choose whether you want to jam along to the beat or just go plain &quot;a cappella&quot;.<br><br>Don&#39;t forget to share your experiences on your favorite social platform! <br><br>Happy Jamming!<br><br><br>(Daft Punk or their record label is not in any way affiliated with this app)<br><br><br>...maybe also some hidden bonus material...",
